{"id":"417349","name":"腊鸭腿萝卜汤","author":"花鱼儿","authorId":"404188","desc":"","cover":"images/417349/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"萝卜","amount":"340克"},{"name":"腊鸭腿","amount":"145克"}],"sub":[{"name":"盐","amount":"适量"},{"name":"味精","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"食材：萝卜、腊鸭腿（已清洗剁成块）。","img":"images/417349/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"将萝卜清洗一下。","img":"images/417349/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"放在案板上切成块，待用。","img":"images/417349/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"将剁成块的腊鸭腿下入清水锅中煮开煮上6分钟。","img":"images/417349/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"接着，合入切好的萝卜翻动一下煮开煮上萝卜熟软。","img":"images/417349/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"然后，加适量的盐。","img":"images/417349/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"加适量的味精。","img":"images/417349/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"调味翻匀即成。","img":"images/417349/step_8.jpg"}],"tips":"试试味道再加盐。 \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}